This repository links out to explanations, problem statements and articles
hosted elsewhere, including Refactoring Guru, Hello Interview, AlgoMaster and
the awesome-low-level-design repository. Those works are the property of their
respective owners and are not covered by the licences above. Nothing here
reproduces them; the links are references, and the explanations and code in this
repository are written from scratch.

Where a problem statement is named — "Design a Parking Lot", "Design Bitly" —
the name refers to the linked source. The design, the code and the commentary
are original.
